// Aristocratic, pompous, obsessed with status, easily irritated by peasants.
// Died while old of a disease no doctor could cure.
// file: lord_xie, speaker: Lord Xie

// ============================================================
// CASUAL
// ============================================================

title: LordXie_Casual_01
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual01
Lord Xie: [auto/] One grows weary of the company at this table. In life, I employed men solely to ensure such riffraff never entered my parlour.
//END: casual01
===

title: LordXie_Casual_02
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual02
Lord Xie: [auto/] The Xie estate once hosted the emperor himself for an evening of cards. He lost graciously, as all men of class do. Unlike the rabble here.
//END: casual02
===

title: LordXie_Casual_03
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual03
Lord Xie: [auto/] Is there no attendant to refresh the table? I forget myself. The dead are their own servants now. How grotesque.
//END: casual03
===

title: LordXie_Casual_04
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual04
Lord Xie: [auto/] I once owned silks finer than anything at this table. Porcelain that would make emperors envious. Now I sit among commoners. The indignity of it.
//END: casual04
===

title: LordXie_Casual_05
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual05
Lord Xie: [auto/] In my household, the pauses between entertainments were filled with fine music and poetry. Here we get silence and the smell of failure.
//END: casual05
===

title: LordXie_Casual_06
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual06
Lord Xie: [auto/] Death was supposed to be a passage to something grander. Instead I find myself at a card table with peasants. The cosmos has a vulgar sense of humour.
//END: casual06
===

title: LordXie_Casual_07
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual07
Lord Xie: [auto/] Poker is a gentleman's pursuit. One reads the opponent as one reads a contract — carefully, and with the expectation that the other party is lying.
//END: casual07
===

title: LordXie_Casual_08
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual08
Lord Xie: [auto/] I have negotiated land deals worth more than everyone at this table combined. A card game is hardly a challenge for a mind such as mine.
//END: casual08
===

title: LordXie_Casual_09
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual09
Lord Xie: [auto/] One does not simply throw chips about like grain to chickens. There is an art to the wager. A refinement that most here sorely lack.
//END: casual09
===

title: LordXie_Casual_10
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual10
Lord Xie: [auto/] Watch and learn from your betters. That is free counsel, and worth more than any of you deserve.
//END: casual10
===

title: LordXie_Casual_11
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual11
Lord Xie: [auto/] Every bet I place carries the weight of three hundred years of Xie family honour. What does yours carry? Desperation, I presume.
//END: casual11
===

title: LordXie_Casual_12
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual12
Lord Xie: [auto/] The cards are merely instruments. The true game is played between minds of quality. I do hope at least one such mind is present tonight.
//END: casual12
===

title: LordXie_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
Lord Xie: [auto/] The Xie estate sprawled across three valleys. Gardens that took forty servants to maintain. Now it rots, and I sit here. Wealth means nothing to the worms.
//END: casual13
===

title: LordXie_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
Lord Xie: [auto/] I summoned every physician in the province. Then the next. Then the capital. Not one could name what was killing me. My gold bought only bewildered faces.
//END: casual14
===

title: LordXie_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
Lord Xie: [auto/] The cruelest truth of death is this: it does not care what your name was. A lord and a beggar rot at the same pace. I have never forgiven it for that.
//END: casual15
===

title: LordXie_Casual_16
tags: casual
speaker: lord_xie
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual16
Lord Xie: [auto/] In the end, the disease took everything my title could not protect. My dignity. My voice. My certainty that I was better than the dirt they buried me in.
//END: casual16
===

// ================================
// GAME STATES
// ================================

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Raise_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction01
Lord Xie: [auto/] What a positively boorish raise. One does not simply fling wealth at a problem. That is how peasants think.
//END: reactaction01
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Fold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction02
Lord Xie: [auto/] A fold? How sensible. One should know one's station and withdraw when outmatched by superior play.
//END: reactaction02
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_AllIn_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction03
Lord Xie: [auto/] All in. How crass. A true nobleman never risks everything at once. That is what expendable servants are for.
//END: reactaction03
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Any_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: any
---
//START: reactaction04
Lord Xie: [auto/] Hmph. A passable move, I suppose. Even a blind pig finds a truffle now and again. No offense intended. Well. Some offense.
//END: reactaction04
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Raise_02
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction05
Lord Xie: [auto/] That raise had a whiff of strategy about it. Surprising. I did not think anyone here capable.
//END: reactaction05
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Call_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: call
---
//START: reactaction06
Lord Xie: [auto/] A call. How dreadfully passive. One either commits or withdraws — hovering in between had people roll their eyes.
//END: reactaction06
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_Check_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: check
---
//START: reactaction07
Lord Xie: [auto/] Checking. A meek little gesture. In my day such hesitation would have been mistaken for poor upbringing, never for cleverness.
//END: reactaction07
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfFold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction08
Lord Xie: [auto/] I fold — a Xie would not dare accept such a stupid loss.
//END: reactaction08
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfAllIn_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction09
Lord Xie: [auto/] Everything, then, all at once. A true lord does not gamble — he simply reclaims what fate had misplaced in lesser hands.
//END: reactaction09
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfRaise_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction10
Lord Xie: [auto/] I raise, of course. Being timid is a luxury for men with no ancestry to answer for.
//END: reactaction10
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfCall_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: call
---
//START: reactaction11
Lord Xie: [auto/] I call. Not from curiosity — merely to grant you the brief and unearned privilege of losing to me directly.
//END: reactaction11
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfCheck_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: check
---
//START: reactaction12
Lord Xie: [auto/] I check. A momentary pause, nothing more. Even emperors paused before affixing their seal to lesser matters.
//END: reactaction12
===

title: LordXie_ReactAction_SelfGeneral_01
tags: react_action
speaker: lord_xie
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: any
---
//START: reactaction13
Lord Xie: [auto/] Every motion of my hand at this table carries three centuries of instinct bred into finer stock than what surrounds me.
//END: reactaction13
===

