requires:
priority: 1
outcome: win
---
//START: showdown02
Lord Xie: [auto/] Victory. The natural order asserts itself once more. Let no one claim luck played a part — this was pure pedigree.
//END: showdown02
===

title: LordXie_Showdown_Lose_01
tags: showdown
speaker: lord_xie
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
outcome: lose
---
//START: showdown03
Lord Xie: [auto/] Preposterous. These cards are clearly defective. In life I would have had the deck maker flogged for such craftsmanship.
//END: showdown03
===

title: LordXie_Showdown_Lose_02
tags: showdown
speaker: lord_xie
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
outcome: lose
---
//START: showdown04
Lord Xie: [auto/] I refuse to accept this outcome. A Xie does not lose — circumstances merely conspire against him temporarily.
//END: showdown04
===

title: LordXie_Showdown_Lose_03
tags: showdown
speaker: lord_xie
category: showdown
target: any
phase: showdown
requires:
priority: 1
outcome: lose
---
//START: showdown05
Lord Xie: [auto/] Defeated by this rabble. If my ancestors could see this, they would die of shame... again.
//END: showdown05
===

