verdict: innocent
---
//START: cheating01
Lord Xie: [auto/] How dare you accuse a Xie of cheating. My family does not cheat. We simply arrange outcomes in our favor.
//END: cheating01
===
title: LordXie_Cheating_Guilty_01
tags: cheating
speaker: lord_xie
category: cheating
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
verdict: guilty
---
//START: cheating02
Lord Xie: [auto/] Preposterous— fine, yes, I cheated. A Xie does what a Xie must to avoid the indignity of losing.
//END: cheating02
===
